{"id":51770,"date":"2026-06-20T17:03:03","date_gmt":"2026-06-20T16:03:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51770"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:38:21","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:38:21","slug":"20-kms-de-almeirim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/20-kms-de-almeirim\/","title":{"rendered":"39\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o 20 Kms de Almeirim 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">39\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o 20 Kms de Almeirim 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A hist\u00f3rica <strong>39\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos 20 Kms de Almeirim 2026 (Rota da Sopa da Pedra)<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Ribatejo, em <strong>Almeirim<\/strong>, distrito de Santar\u00e9m. Organizada pela consagrada <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o 20 Kms de Almeirim<\/strong> com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Almeirim e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m, a prova \u00e9 um dos maiores cl\u00e1ssicos do atletismo de estrada em Portugal.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas na zona do <strong>Parque das T\u00edlias e Pra\u00e7a de Touros de Almeirim<\/strong>, o percurso ribatejano \u00e9 c\u00e9lebre por ser totalmente plano, largo e muito favor\u00e1vel a grandes marcas. O evento disponibiliza os m\u00edticos <strong>20 km<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Mini\/Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o garante chip eletr\u00f3nico integrado Lap2Go, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos de topo, seguro desportivo e a cobi\u00e7ada medalha finisher.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech